    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19875" root="سعو and سعى" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَسْعًى</span></b> , syn. with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَعْىٌ</span>, [an inf. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَعَى</span>,]
signifying The act of <i>running,</i> and <i>working,</i> and
<i>earning</i> or <i>gaining,</i> [&amp;c., when used as a simple
subst.,] has for its pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَسَاعٍ</span>. (Har p. 384.)

